{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17322453","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17322453","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1732245301:0":{"text":"I wish! I only heard about a potion like that somewhere.","source_cn":"怎么可能！我只是记得在哪里听过类似效果魔法药剂的消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB384E7A14D7F3C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732245302:0":{"text":"All I've got here are potions to help you sleep better, improve your skin, and promote hair growth...","source_cn":"我这摊位上只有治疗失眠的好梦魔药，还有让皮肤变好的水润...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47EBE1FB9DD2DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732245303:0":{"text":"They don't seem to solve any real problems...","source_cn":"听起来都是些没什么实质用处的魔法药剂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F29E5456FC64EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732245304:0":{"text":"Just what the nobles need, because they don't have any real troubles to begin with.","source_cn":"这些魔法药剂都是卖给贵族老爷们的，他们也没有实质性的烦恼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09BBBF8C891A2DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摊主斯丹佛":{"text":"Owner Stanver","source":"摊主斯丹佛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军赛门":{"text":"Guard Symon","source":"守备